window.products.push({"id":410110,"name":"Elivo Hospital Bed Bath Blankets - Ideal for Warmth and Privacy During Bed Baths - Made Cotton - Work Great as, Recovery, Thermal or Utility Blankets ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Erv6RbyEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Have you been looking for a bed bath blanket which could help provide essential privacy during a bed bath, has effective absorption capacity and is durable enough? Are you a caregiver or nurse who often has to offer bed baths and need something that will provide the required warmth and comfort during the bath? Well, we heard you loud and clear! We bring to you a bath blanket that’s ideal for bed baths and something you would find functionally very effective. Some of the many benefits of our blanket are: ELIVO BED BATH BLANKET Generous Size - 70 x 90 inches in size to let you comfortably cover the patient  Made from Exceptional Quality Yarn and Napped from both Sides for Comfort Made up of 88% cotton and 12% polyester Weighs 1.5 lb (pounds) Soft and Comfortable in touch Highly breathable and lightweight Provides essential privacy and warmth during sponge baths or bed baths Durable - maintains its color and shape even after several wash cycles Able to withstand institutional laundering Unbleached - has natural off-white colour Can be put to several other uses - as recovery, thermal or utility blanket Note - These blankets are not designed to be used as Bedspreads as these are lightweight and thin hospital bed bath blankets meant to cover an individual during a bed bath or a sponge bath. 100% Risk-Free Satisfaction Guarantee We also offer you 100% risk-free satisfaction guarantee to let you buy with confidence; no questions asked. However, we are quite sure you will love these blankets for they perform their function quite well. So, why think twice? ORDER NOW and get this incredible Elivo Bed Bath Blanket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Erv6RbyEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elivo","source_asin":"B01C901T58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01C901T58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01C901T58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
