window.products.push({"id":410121,"name":"84 feet Artificial Vines Greenery Garland Fake Hanging Leaves Faux Foliage Plants for Wedding Party Garden Home Kitchen Office Wall Decorations (Water","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e-Cr9jcmL._AC_SL1048_.jpg","description":"FEATURES 1.Artificial vine plants is a low-maintenance decoration for any nature-inspired space. 2.Exquisite color dyeing technology makes fake garland leaves distinctly green with clear texture. 3.The silk artificial vine leaves connect tightly to the plastic stem via injection molding technology, which are hard to fall off. 4.The artificial greenery garland is washable, with foliage color hardly fading after high temperature ironing process. PRODUCT PARAMETERS 1. Package include：12 or 24 strands artificial vines. 2. Fake garland length: approx. 7 feet (2.1 m) each strand, total length 84 or 168 feet (25.2 m or 50.4 m). 3. Artificial vine leaves size：80 leaves per strand. Big leaves size: approx. 1.8x1.8 inch (4.5x4.5cm), small leaves size: approx. 1.4x1.4 inch (3.5x3.5cm). 4. Fake garland leaves material: Silk (waterproof, avoid soaking). 5. Artificial ivy garland stem material: High strength plastic (support outdoor decoration). What scenario can artificial vine plants be used? 1. Wedding decoration: wedding arch, table, chair, garland, gate, etc. 2. Party decoration: background, light, cosplay, costume, baby birthday, baby shower etc. 3. Outdoor: patio, yard, wall, balcony, fence, garden, gate pillar, trellis, swing, farmhouse, rockery, curtain, etc. 4. Indoor: wall, bedroom, kitchen, staircase, bookshelf, window, door, ceiling, office, mirror, lamp, exhibition, etc. NOTE: 1.Artificial vine plants maybe case some plastic smell in the long time's package. Pls open and hang where the air convection in 1-2 days. The plastic smell it will go away normally. 2.This item size information is just for reference only, and allow 1-2in differences due to manual measurement. 3.Due to the difference between different monitors, the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71e-Cr9jcmL._AC_SL1048_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZWYOQI","source_asin":"B09Z7QPSVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z7QPSVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z7QPSVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":410122,"name":"Irish Salt and Pepper Shaker Celtic Design Shamrock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610Sh6nrT7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These salt and pepper shakers beautifully depict the iconic shamrock prominent in Celtic lore and, at its heart, is featured in the triple spiral enclosed by the Irish weave pattern.  These shakers will, with their brilliant colors, elegantly grace any table and perhaps add a touch of magic – for Celtic mythology attributes the shamrock with magical powers.  These shakers stand tall at 8 cm high and can easily guard against evil spirits!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610Sh6nrT7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Tara","source_asin":"B00JDNLXH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JDNLXH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JDNLXH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
