window.products.push({"id":410136,"name":"Pack of 4 Silicone Cooking Utensils Set, Non Stick Large Solid Spatulas, Heat Resistant Rose Gold Khaki Slotted Spoons, Ideal BPA Free Kitchen Turners","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PlylEp37L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MORE SAFE AND HEALTHY: Unlike other ordinary sellers, we pay more attention to the safety of product materials.Our non-stick silicone cooking utensil sets are made of food-grade silicone, free of BPA. Even at high temperatures of 446℉ (230℃), there is no need to worry about melting or deforming. At the same time, the soft silicone head won't scratch the coating, which can better protect your pot. THE MOST THOUGHTFUL DESIGN: The high-quality 18/8 stainless steel is more durable and keeps you away from the trouble of kitchen utensils rusting or breaking. The anti-scald silicone handle is not easy to conduct heat and is more comfortable to hold than traditional utensils. While you enjoy a happy cooking time, you can better protect your hands from being scalded. EASY TO CLEAN & STORAGE : After each use, just wipe with hot water , you can easily clean and remove excess fat and food.The design of the round hanging hole makes it easier to dry. MEET YOUR DIFFERENT DAILY NEEDS: This set contains 4 pcs utensils with different functions. Unique mute design, no noise when cooking.Thin and flexible edge of the silicone turner is ideal for flipping,frying and turning food. Large capacity design of cooking spoon, used to hold food more convenient. Slotted Spoon can quickly drain the water . OUR SERVICE: No one is born to be a good cook, but good kitchenware often gets twice the result with half the effort. Bundlepro is a trusted kitchen utensil expert, we have been committed to providing customers with the highest quality kitchen utensils. If you have any questions about our products, please dont hesitate to contact us, we will be very happy to serve you !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PlylEp37L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUNDLEPRO","source_asin":"B09XDJYTY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDJYTY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDJYTY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
