window.products.push({"id":410148,"name":"Grapefruit Spoons Knives Utensils Set – 12 Pack Premium Set Grapefruit Knives Straight Blade Curved Serrated Spoons Straw Brush Silicone Straws Citrus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WGW0GPzlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍋 COMPLETE SET FOR CITRUS FRUITS LOVERS - We offer you a high quality complete set of utensils so that you make the most of a fruit meal, especially citrus fruits such as grapefruits, lemons, oranges, but also watermelon, kiwi. This set is designed to cover all needs of a citrus fruits lover, from splitting in halves the fruit, digging and scooping with ease, collecting the remaining juice and pulp with appropriate reusable silicone straws, up to storing the remaining half-grapefruit for later. 🍈 4 SERRATED GRAPEFRUIT SPOONS - Made of thick stainless steel our chef craft spoons are serrated on both sides, which makes them accessible utensils in the kitchen for preparing your grapefruit salad or any other fruit salad; The serrated edges on the spoon will help with the sectioning through the citrus membrane, allowing you to get all of the fruit out easily. 🍉 2 DIFFERENT TYPES OF GRAPEFRUIT KNIVES - The set also includes 1 straight blade one-sided serrated grapefruit knife and 1 curved tip serrated grapefruit knife, both made of high quality stainless steel with non-slip handle; The straight blade knife cuts effortlessly in half the grapefruit or other fruits; Use the curved knife for separating the pulp sections of fruits, gently and with minimal waste. 🥝 GRAPEFRUIT RECIPIENT - You don’t feel like eating the whole grapefruit? Use half of it and store the rest in our bright and colourful recipient which is BPA free; This way the fruit will last longer, plus the recipient will be easy to spot regardless of whether it's in your fridge, countertop, picnic basket or wherever you may have misplaced it. 🍹 4 ECO-FRIENDLY REUSABLE SILICONE STRAWS – After the spoons and knives would have worked into grapefruit, the reusable silicone straws will finish the job, collecting with ease the remaining juice and pulp pieces. You will not waste anything! The set includes a brush for the straws, to be able to clean it after use and thus reuse the high-quality silicone straws for other drinks you may feel drinking, including shakes. It is not only simple and functional but long-lasting; Maximum efficiency!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WGW0GPzlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PROSSMART","source_asin":"B07W3J499H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W3J499H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W3J499H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
