window.products.push({"id":410180,"name":"IMIKEYA Round Table Cover Table Protector Transparent PVC Tablecloth for 45-56 Inch Diameter Table Extra Clear Plastic Fitted Waterproof Table Protect","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OSaeH9ZeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Covering our table protector on your round tables, and then have a big feast without worrying the food residues, coffee s or any other unpleasant s dropping down to your tabletops. In this way, you can protect your tabletop to an, and won't cover the beautiful tabletop since it's super clear. Please be sure that our round table protector is suitable for round tables with a diameter of 45- 56\". Features - Brand: IMIKEYA.- Color: Transparent.- Material: PVC.- Size: 150cm ( diameter ).- Clear PVC round table cover fits for your round tables with the diameter range from 45\" to 56\", keeps your table away from any unwanted s. - Fitted with elastic band, saves you a lot of troubles and eliminates the risk of accidentally pulling the table cover.- This round table protector with moderate elasticity and thickness, not easy to tear and wrinkle, clear design means you can see the beautiful tabletop underneath.- Super easy to clean, if there is oil and water s on the table protector, you can just wipe it off with a damp cloth.- Ideal for hotels, restaurants, cafes, patios, home, canteens, and other catering facilities. Package Including 1 x IMIKEYA Round Table Protector","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OSaeH9ZeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMIKEYA","source_asin":"B08V1348JT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V1348JT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V1348JT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":410181,"name":"Tokyo Japan Skyline by Michael Tompsett, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zq1k2RD8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a colorful skyline of Tokyo Japan. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies after leaving University. After 12 highly enjoyable years Michael Tompsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Although Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, his main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Michael Tompsett creates Urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Zq1k2RD8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B016M0PVK0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016M0PVK0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016M0PVK0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
