window.products.push({"id":410219,"name":"Wine & Whiskey Decanter, Hunting Gifts, Hunter with Dog - 750ml Decanter Bourbon Scotch Unique Gift for Him - Gamebirds Game - Hunter's Cowboy Decante","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZE-2HHSzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Man with Dog Hunting Bullet Whiskey Decanter is a nod to the Western frontier, with an image of a man who's out for the hunt. Intricate cuts and shaping make this decanter one of a kind. The man with his hunting dog adorn this unique decanter with an embossing bottom to give it a finished look. This decanter also comes with it's own wood stand and is large enough to hold 750ml of whiskey, scotch, bourbon or other liquor. This piece has detailed hues of black, brown and blue. This regal hunting dog whiskey decanter is sure to be a great addition to your place setting or bar. The decanter features a bullet shaped stopper at the top of the decanter. This unique whiskey decanter has a glass body that measures 12\" in height and approximately 5\" in width and is made from mouth blown glass making it high quality and durable. Journey into the world of whiskey with this heavily detailed Man with a dog hunting decanter! A man and a dog are depicted in a old time hunting-style dynamic. The hunting dog stands proudly under the man leading his \"best friend\" into a hunt. This beautiful hand-crafted mouth blown colored borosilicate glass decanter is specially designed to capture your favorite spirits. A detailed scene of a rustic western town motif that comes comes packed in an attractive gift box and makes a great gift! Fancy a drink? Why not try this Revolutionary whiskey decanter! Shine up your favorite spirit with this unique and distinct decanter at your home bar. This whiskey decanter is a unique decoration, centerpiece, or conversation starter. Attention to detail is what separates high quality decanters from the rest. It makes for a fantastic gift for the man in your life who's always had everything, or the guy who appreciates small details like this one. Can you imagine a more unique gift than this? The wine decanter stands on the base and the man with dog looks like he is in action with his 5 shooter out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZE-2HHSzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wine Savant","source_asin":"B08Z65D272","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z65D272","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z65D272","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
