window.products.push({"id":410341,"name":"OTOTO Agatha Spoon Holder for Stove Top - Witchy Gifts for Homecooks - Spatula Holder and Cooking Spoon Rest for Stove Top and Kitchen Counter - Heat-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HtJo0uzOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bewitching Kitchen Spoon Rest - Looking for witch gifts this spooky season? From Salem to your kitchen, Design Awarded OTOTO Studio brings you this adorable little witch to hold utensils on your cauldron while you brew a delicious potion. Made of food-grade, BPA-free silicone, this heat-resistant holder can be placed near the stove or in the dining area for a more convenient serving and meal prepping. Hex'citing Gift for Anyone - Looking for new home gift ideas or funny housewarming gifts? How about a unique utensil holder that's cute and nifty? This spoon holder for kitchen is the perfect present for foodies, home cooks, master chefs, and anyone who loves an enchanting surprise. It's a bedazzling cooking spoon rest and spatula holder for stove top and kitchen counter. Watch this purple magic wielder cast a spell to anyone who receives it! Spellbinding Cooking Staple - Say goodbye to drips and drops on countertops! Simply place the ladle holder on a bubbling pot and behold - Agatha doesn't slide or slip, just like how she rides broomsticks with firm grip. Hocus pocus, here's a bonus: this item also functions as a steam releaser! Multitasking in the kitchen is now easier with this witch who prevents spill and splatter. This spatula rest combines fun and function, making it the ultimate kitchen staple! Hag'ssle-Free Meal Prepping - Concoct delightful recipes with no hassle for Agatha is here while you hustle! Whether you're using a spoon, spatula, spaghetti server, or a ladle, this tiny hag ensures you comfortable cooking. No need to scatter utensils on a tray. Let it sit on the pot to save precious space. When you're done, simply toss Agatha into the dishwasher for quick and easy clean. A magical kitchen item, you say? Careful what you 'witch' for! A Sprinkle of fun- Ever heard of the one where they lived happily ever after? Well, that's always the story with OTOTO's household products. Why? Because everyday chores are no longer a bore when you've got adorable gadgets to explore! Our team strives to create functional products with a quirky and unexpected twist. We love sprinkling in a bit of fun and magic in all that we do and we hope you feel the same way too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HtJo0uzOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTOTO","source_asin":"B0C24NLT4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C24NLT4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C24NLT4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
