window.products.push({"id":410396,"name":"Hiware LZS13B 12 Inches Stainless Steel Mixing Spoon, Spiral Pattern Bar Cocktail Shaker Spoon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xmg-8MuuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE & PROFESSIONAL. Long, professional and well balanced - this cocktail mixing spoon has the most outstanding and attractive advantages. Effortlessly mixes and blends cocktails with just simple stirs, allowing you to create tasty and beautiful looking drinks. SUPERIOR QUALITY MATERIALS. The classy 18/10 stainless steel material makes it be long - term used with no problems. It will not be bent ,rust or remain odor even if it is used for a long time. Retains the durability and healthy of this material. Meantime, it is DISHWASHER SAFE. PROFESSIONAL DESIGNS - ESPECIALLY THE FUNCTIONAL LENGTH. At 12 inches it has the ideal length for stirring drinks in taller glasses. Easily reaches the bottom of any cocktail shaker and mixing glass. The twist of the spoon makes it easier to grip and enhance the mixing strength while the striking teardrop design will accent your bartending skills. FUNCTIONAL USES. This mixing spoon is perfect for mixing martini, margarita, rum, whisky, vodka, scotch, brandy, tequila and some beverages like smoothies, milkshakes, juices and more. Typically used in bars, cafes, restaurants, Bistrot au Vin, parties, offices and even homes. AN AFFORDABLE MAGIC FOR YOU OR YOUR FRIENDS. Whether you want to give it to a friend as a souvenir or use it yourself for an entertaining evening, it's an easily affordable item. This spoon is a clever addition to your life and guess what? - If your looking for a spoon to get that last bit of mayonnaise or peanut butter out of the jar, look no further this is the one you need!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xmg-8MuuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIWARE","source_asin":"B0C6KCBT4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6KCBT4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6KCBT4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
