window.products.push({"id":410441,"name":"Glotoch Tempered Glass Mason Jars 12 Pack, 10 oz. with Regular Mouth Lids and Bands - Ideal for Spices, Canning, Pickling, Preserves, Storage, Crafts,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81orIDSNn5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-Quality Glass Jars: Each jar measures 3.7\" x 3\", these 10 oz. (1.25 cups) ball glass mason jars are made of tempered glass that's resistant to cracking and stress. The mason jars can be used for storing: coffee, sugar, flour, cereal, cookies, baking soda, food or whatever you need on your kitchen shelves. Along with the jars, the set also includes 12 chalkboard labels and 1 brush. Versatile & Multipurpose: Lightweight, stackable and versatile glass mason jars make it easy to create delicious, eye-catching displays anywhere. Ideal for storing your kitchen condiments such as sauces, honey, flour, rubs, tea or coffee. In addition, these jars make great souvenirs for special occasions such as weddings, baby showers, arts, crafts, and DIY projects. Easy Meal Preparation: Our mason jars are perfect for canning, pickling and preserving food. These jars are easy to use and clean. You can preserve food for storage in your pantry. Used for seasonings, jam, jelly, pickles, olives, sauerkraut, sauces, salsa, baby food, drinks, and candles. The jars are also great for meal prep by storing chopped fruits, nuts, vegetables, soup, and so much more. Dishwashing Safe: Whether you're using them for home canning, storing kitchen ingredients, or giving someone handmade goods as a gift, these jars are as versatile as they are beautiful. The jars have ribbed lids for great grip and easy opening. The lids seal is airtight and the durable tempered glass ensures they are dishwasher safe and can be reused many times over. Quality assurance. If for any reason our tempered glass or mason jar sets do not meet your needs, please contact our customer service team. We offer quick and hassle-free assistance to resolve any issues that may arise!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81orIDSNn5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glotoch Express","source_asin":"B081SHKPGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081SHKPGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081SHKPGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
