window.products.push({"id":410501,"name":"West Bend 41077 Just For Dinner Breadmaker (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H2E6E4PCL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Bake a 3/4-lb. loaf in just 45 minutes with this West Bend oval breadmaker. The compact unit is equipped with settings for basic and specialty breads, as well as a window to peek in on the baking process, LED indicators and a 1-hour automatic warming cycle. The pan has a nonstick coating, which lets the finished loaf slide right out and makes cleanup easy. Includes instruction and recipe booklet. Made in USA. 9Hx10Wx11-1/2L\". Amazon.com Ideal for dinner parties of two or four, this breadmaker produces aromatic, piping hot fresh bread in 45 minutes. Compact enough to easily fit on a countertop (or table!), the appliance produces loaves that are 3-1/2 inches by 5-1/2 inches and 4-1/2 inches tall, just the right size for intimate dinner parties. The oval bread pan gives the loaves a distinctive shape and a little dimple. Operation is as easy as putting the dough into the breadmaker and pressing two buttons, and several recipes are included, such as sunflower oat wheat, Swiss-jalapeño, and feta cheese--and nutritional information for each recipe is also included. The directions are extensive, complete with a troubleshooting guide. The breadmaker's viewing window is especially nice, and lets you watch your bread take shape. This breadmaker comes with a 90-day warranty. --Ariel Meadow Stallings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41H2E6E4PCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Bend","source_asin":"B00005KIR0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005KIR0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005KIR0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
