window.products.push({"id":410616,"name":"VonShef Round Digital Electronic Kitchen Food Scale - 11lb/5kg Capacity - Slim Stainless Steel & LCD Display Screen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U+2CILLML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prepare your recipes down to a tee with help from the VonShef Round Stainless Steel Kitchen Scales. An attractive and practical addition to any modern kitchen, these highly accurate scales are equally as useful for baking a batch of delicious cupcakes as they are for cooking a slap-up evening meal. With a maximum capacity of 5kg / 11lb / 176oz - accurate to the nearest 1g/2oz - you can rely on the VonShef Scales to provide ultra-reliable readings via the large backlit LCD display screen.  Readings can be set to display in Grams (g), Kilograms (kg), Pounds and Ounces (lb;oz), so whether you prefer your measurements in imperial or metric, these are the scales for you. Equipped with up to the minute technology, the scales feature zero/ tare functionality – which lets you weigh different ingredients at the same time, in the same bowl. Great for keeping washing up to a minimum! There’s also a ‘negative’ mode which lets you place any type of bowl on the scales and start from zero. A handy overload indicator tells you when the weight has exceeded maximum capacity, and the scales also come with a low battery indicator and auto shut off. Sleek, modern brushed Stainless Steel design is guaranteed to look the part on your kitchen work top. Easy clean - just wipe down with a damp cloth.  Great for domestic and professional kitchens alike. Size: 9.5 x 7.4 x 1.3\"  Powered by 2 x 1.5V AAA Batteries (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U+2CILLML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VonShef","source_asin":"B01GPZ1D54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GPZ1D54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GPZ1D54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
