window.products.push({"id":410687,"name":"TRUSTLIFE Corner Shower Caddy 2-Pack - Adhesive Corner Shelf with Hooks for Inside Shower, No Drilling & Rustproof Shower Storage Rack for Bathroom, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61THYi1CjFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝗗𝘂𝗿𝗮𝗯𝗹𝗲 𝗠𝗮𝘁𝗲𝗿𝗶𝗮𝗹: Our shower corner caddy is made of space aluminum with hand polished and matte spray paint coat, so the surface is smooth, both modern beauty and practicality. This quality metal shower caddy corner is durable, rustproof and scratch-resistant. After a simple cleaning, it immediately looks new. Stay clean and elegant. 𝗟𝗮𝗿𝗴𝗲𝗿 𝗖𝗮𝗽𝗮𝘀𝗶𝘁𝘆: The size of these bathroom shower caddys are 11.7*9.1*1.3 inches, enough to hold your daily toiletries, you can store shampoo, body wash, face wash, soap, razor, and extra hooks for you to hang towels or bath balls. This shower shelf will help you organize and save space in your bathroom and toilet. Using our product, you will be very convenient when you take a shower. 𝗦𝘁𝗿𝗼𝗻𝗴𝗲𝗿 𝗔𝗱𝗵𝗲𝘀𝗶𝘃𝗲: The shower rack won't damage your wall by holding it securely in place with a strong, traceless adhesive, eliminating the need for drilling with tools. Each shower organizer can hold up to 22lbs. Waterproof and moistureproof, so you don't have to worry about your items falling and damaged. Note: These shower caddies must be applied to smooth walls; do not attach the product to painted walls, wallpaper, lime walls or other soft or uneven surfaces. 𝗖𝘂𝘀𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗲 𝗖𝗮𝗿𝗲: The adhesive bathroom organizer is designed with an open grid for maximum ventilation and dripping to keep bath products dry and clean. The rounded and smooth edges are designed to not cut your hands. The corner storage holder shelves have strong adhesive and high load-bearing capacity allow you to press toiletries directly for use. 𝗣𝗮𝗰𝗸𝗮𝗴𝗲 𝗖𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘁𝘀: 2 corner shower caddies, 4 removable hooks, 4 adhesive pads, 1 tool bag, 1 instrction manual. After installation, please wait 24 hours before putting anything on it to ensure maximum firmness. These shower caddy shelves are not only suitable for bathrooms, but also for kitchen, toilet or college dorm room. If you receive the goods with defects or damages, please contact us for replacement. We will try our best to give you satisfying service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61THYi1CjFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRUSTLIFE","source_asin":"B09WYNBLNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WYNBLNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WYNBLNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":410688,"name":"MOTINI 100% Wool Cube Pouf Square Ottoman Foot Stool Knit Braided Cord Boho Pouf Footrest for Living Room Bedroom Nursery, Dark Grey, 18\" x 18\" x 18\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SOK5zPFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exude Natural Vibes: This pouf adds a classic touch and exceptional texture & style to any home. The braided texture of wool fiber give it both traditional and luxurious feel that will be a perfect addition to either rustic-chic or contemporary styles. Wool Pouf: Handwoven of thick, sustainable, and durable natural 100% Wool fibers. Dense EPS beads fill is supportive and holds its shape longer. Measures: 18\"W x 18\"L x 19\"H. Occasion: Timeless design and practical size make these poufs great for floor sitting. Great way to make your couch or chair even more comfortable with added foot stool for support. Great way to add pop up seating when your friends are visiting. Perfect for watching TV and playing games. Hand Crafted with Care: Hand made poufs carry the spirit of the artisans that made them. This collection is artisanal in both conception and construction. Spot clean with mild soap and a soft-bristled brush if stained. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed: Each pouf is inspected by a skilled artisan to ensure the best finished product possible. MOTINI guarantees to provide 3-Month return and replacement service & life-time free customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SOK5zPFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOTINI","source_asin":"B08MVYY5X9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MVYY5X9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MVYY5X9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":410689,"name":"Corelle Ultra 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4, Garden Gate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518QTXJFF7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Corelle Ultra 16-Piece Set, Service for 4, includes 4-each 10-3/4-inchDinner Plates, 8-1/2-inch Salad Plates, 15-ounce Rimmed Soup/CerealBowls, 15-ounce Stoneware Mugs, Garden Gate Amazon.com Created for substantial heft, enduring use, and attractive table setting, the Corelle Ultra collection features a range of pretty patterns that are 70 percent thicker than standard Corelle. The Garden Gate line is a great example with its clean silhouettes, smart stacking design, and handsome motif. The colors in the pattern are a warm blend of earth tones for versatile use all year long, and the motif takes its inspiration from wrought iron and leaves. Crafted from incredibly durable layers of laminated glass, Garden Gate doesn't chip or scratch with frequent use, and its fired-on glazes resist fading. The starting place for a Garden Gate collection, this set includes four place settings, each with a 10-1/4-inch dinner plate, a 8-1/2-inch salad plate, a 15-ounce soup bowl, and an 11-ounce mug. With 16 pieces in all, the set is safe in the dishwasher, microwave, and oven to 350 degrees F. It carries a 5-year breakage replacement warranty. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box :4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 10-1/4-inch dinner plate; 8-1/2-inch salad plate; 15-ounce soup bowl; 11-ounce mug. 16 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518QTXJFF7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Corelle","source_asin":"B000HZV9M6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HZV9M6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HZV9M6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
