window.products.push({"id":410834,"name":"Can Opener, Can Openers Hand Held, 4 in 1 Smooth Edge Hand Held Bottle Opener, Professional Heavy Duty Beer Can Opener Ultra Sharp Food Safe Jar Opene","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yf1J3mG8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How to Use Heavy Duty Manual Can Opener: 1. Open the handle, and then clamp the can edge with the blade and gear. 2. Adjust the angle until the lower magnet block cling closely to the outer side of the can. 3. Press the handles until the blade pierced the can lid. 4. Turn the knob clockwise and then use the magnet to lift the lid off. ( leave a connection if needed.) Tips You Need to Keep in Mind: 1. If your can is out of shape, it may cause the can opener off track or get stuck when turning. 2. The magnet block must cling closely to the outer side wall of the can, otherwise the blade and gear would get stuck when turning. 3. Hand wash it soon after using, the food liquid left on the blade may corrode the screw thus getting rust.  Can openers is made of high quality food safety stainless steel.The cutting blade is heat treated. Not easy to rust or rupture. A multifunctional helper 4-in-1 jar opener can open cans, beer bottles, unscrew bottle caps and pry the canned lids. It works with tin can, oil can, milk can,cat dog food can, metal can, aluminum can, beer can, small can, large can, round can, water bottle, jar etc. Cleaning ways Rinse in warm water with a little detergent or just put it under running water. And wipe it with dry cloth or air dry. Note: 1.Pay attention to the sharp blade in case of hurting. Keep it out of kids’ reach. 2.Please be careful of the removed lid, as it’s sharp. Keep it away from kids. 3.Clean the tin opener and dry it after cleaning. The high quality stainless steel blade will never rust. 4.It works with all round or oral cans except rectangle or irregular cans. 5.Keep it away from fire and high temperature to prevent the plastic handle deformation. A gift to your belovedation make it suitable for kids, adults, seniors and anyone with weak hand strength. Package include 1 x can opener 2 x spare blades","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yf1J3mG8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOY LI","source_asin":"B08JTWQ2Z5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-410834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JTWQ2Z5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JTWQ2Z5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
